; A price is the same price wherever its symbol is written, so a per-unit
; pair that differs only in that still cancels and leaves the exchange.
2024-01-07 Wash and exchange
    Assets:Brokerage   10 AAPL @ $150
    Assets:Custody    -10 AAPL @ 150 $
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD

; The same holds for a total price.
2024-01-08 Wash at a total and exchange
    Assets:Brokerage   10 AAPL @@ $1500
    Assets:Custody    -10 AAPL @@ 1500 $
    Assets:Euros      100 EUR
    Assets:Dollars   -110 USD
